  "tagTexts": "shoes | ",
  "shortDescription": "*Running *Swimming *Hiking *Biking *Odorless *Affordable *No socks",
  "projectStory": "Project story\nCreator\nNOVA NATION\nmore infocontact\nCategory\nHealth & Fitness\nTags\nshoes\nBacking information\nCrowdfunding risks\nlearn more\n \nNova Nation is a basement company that we started 18 months ago.\n\nI have always enjoyed running and hiking, but always found it difficult to carry extra pair of shoes to be able to hike and at the same time run into the water. Therefore, I started to look for alternative shoes that would allow me to use one pair of shoes but in different terrains.\nThis is where the story of Nova Nation started!\nI began to try different fabrics and rubber soles for my idea, \"the ultimate all terrain shoe\"\n\nMy passion is running and I wanted to make a robust rubber sole without adding to much weight on the shoe. I spent a lot of time on the treadmill, trying jogging in different type of rubber sole shoes in order to find \"the ultimate all terrain shoe\". \nOnce the type of rubber was identified, I started testing the rubber in water as this is extremely crucial for us. The key was to make sure no water was left in the shoe after you leave the water, hence we chose to use a mesh material and keep the holes into the entire shoe.\nNova is fully waterproof and you can easily go from running on track and later to dirt then go for a swim in the ocean, using only one pair of shoes.\nOnly 1 second to tie your shoes \nThe magnetic shoelaces are one of the best functionalities of Nova, and the idea is to keep the same perfect fit and strength and not having the regular shoes laces which many times loosens up during a jog which can be disturbing the actual work out.\nThis is our first stretch goal\nThe magnetic shoelaces are fully waterproofed so you can run, walk or swim with your Nova shoes in the water.\nWith Nova, you can skip wearing socks while you train, because we wanted to create a barefoot type of shoe. The mesh material makes this possible and it will eliminate the odor while jogging/swimming sockless.  \nNova is odorless and your feet will not sweet like with normal running shoes! \nThere will be no limitations with your NOVA NATION shoe; we wanted to create a pair of shoes that can go from running to jumping, hiking and swimming and at the same time keep a perfect fit for your feet.\nWe made a super light all terrain shoe that weight's around 3.5 once /  100 grams.\n\nThe weight depends on your shoe size, we also made four different colors to fit your style. \nThe materials are not only very light they are also super flexible; this is to give the bare foot feeling. \nWe also added extra soft rubber at the front and the back in order to get the extra grip while you are running. Every detail is important to make the ultimate terrain shoe and we covered every little detail of the shoes for Nova to be up there with the top terrain shoe brands.\nIf you are like many other runners that don’t like socks while you are running, then we can gladly say that you don't need to worry about that anymore with Nov as it is 100% odorless and allows your feet to breathe while you are working out.\nEasy storage comes handy with the magnetic shoe laces, hang them until next time.\nThe idea wasn't just to make an all terrain shoe, we also wanted to keep the retail cost low, and we can make that happen with your help as we want Nova Nation be a shoe that everyone can afford and not a high end shoes. This is a shoe made from a simple idea from our home 18 months ago and today we are asking your help to make this to a reality for you and us.\n\n\n\n \nJust two different Nova's hanging without any reason at all.\nSaltwater? Not a problem! Simply go from running on the beach to the water and get back to the beach again, you can rinse your Nova's after a day at the beach to get the salt off your shoes for your own comfort.\nThis has been an amazing journey for us, and we want to continue this journey with you. We have more ideas in pipeline in which our backers will be the first ones to know.\nWe are constantly working to find ways to create a life style and community for our customers. One great new tool which is under construction is an application in which every Nova user can sign on and share different hiking, jogging, and swimming locations, so that other users can easily find places to be active on. This to promote active life style and make our follower’s lives easy!\nEveryone will be able to share their experience with each other and add new tracks for running, hiking swimming etc\nWhen we told you at the beginning of the campaign that this was a basement company, well it started in Janet's basement.\nThat was 18 months ago, today we are still part time in Janet's basement and part time testing our Nova shoes. Hence we are still working on adjusting the shoe to perfection! The idea of Nova Nation came from Janet and her love for running and hiking, today she only uses a pair of Nova's for her run no matter what the surface is.\nThe passion for running and design has lead us to become the creators of potentially the world’s “Ultimate Terrain Shoes”, and with your help we will deliver the best all terrain shoes on the market. We will not stop there as we want to build a community around Nova Nation and we want you to be part of it from day one!\nSharing is caring, if you like NOVA like we do please share our campaign with your friends and family.\nIf you have any questions to us please ask us on the comments or send us a private email if you want to know more about Nova Nation.\nSend your question to: info@nova-nation.net\nThank you for reading and watching our campaign, we can't wait to deliver your Nova Nation shoes, let's keep moving forward.",
